  "Design Code"
]]]></Value>
    </codeType>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWhere public rights of way/bridleways or byways are located at the boundary, proposed buildings \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Ebe orientated to provide active and attractive frontages. This is to create effective natural and passive surveillance to enhance safety, usage, and security for users of these active travel routes. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EException:\u003C/strong\u003E Where the route runs alongside a side elevation, careful design consideration must be given to ensure visual engagement without compromising the overall street layout or dwelling orientation.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
